                centers, two in Haiti and one in Ecuador. Each CSP center welcomes
                around 30 mothers and their babies and pregnant women. These women
                receive training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on
                a regular basis and Bible lessons.

                We are very grateful to you for your interest towards mothers and their
                babies and for the hope you are bringing to them through your help.
            </field>
            <!-- MyCompassion tab -->
            <field name="activate_for_my_compassion" eval="True"/>
            <field name="my_compassion_donation_type">fund</field>
            <field name="my_compassion_name">Helping Mothers and Babies</field>
            <field name="my_compassion_color" ref="theme_compassion_2025.mid_pink"/>
            <field name="my_compassion_pictogram" ref="theme_compassion_2025.pictogram_mothers_and_babies"/>
